                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "176a07d5-15d4-345f-aa28-a8d989b68c28",
                                        "entry_id": "2f5647d7-648e-34ba-8881-80125f10cbec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Splendid; magnificent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4e9e9fe5-8779-3e6e-921e-fe67fb90014c",
                                        "entry_id": "2f5647d7-648e-34ba-8881-80125f10cbec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or pertaining to the pontifices of Ancient Rome."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "39e6c15a-14d0-31c1-8b28-cf9b5af72c73",
                                        "entry_id": "2f5647d7-648e-34ba-8881-80125f10cbec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to the building or forming of bridges."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "poetic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "82464c1f-94f7-4983-96f8-ec4ef7c16e67",
                                                "sense_id": "39e6c15a-14d0-31c1-8b28-cf9b5af72c73",
                                                "text": "Now had they brought the work by wondrous art / Pontifical, a ridge of pendent rock / Over the vexed abyss."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "pontifical",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d0f66232-3031-3f62-bc49-c92a6e62889c",
                                        "entry_id": "2b2c4a82-9031-38cb-81c2-34a1ed7090c0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A book containing the offices, or formulas, used by a pontiff."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a5b5d0f-ef1d-4610-a29e-a0bb00c4e84e",
                                                "sense_id": "d0f66232-3031-3f62-bc49-c92a6e62889c",
                                                "text": "If the editio princeps was an attempt to create an authoritative version of the pontifical, such was not yet attainable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c4082602-1f9a-4f0c-ae1d-b4095c979397",
                                                "sense_id": "d0f66232-3031-3f62-bc49-c92a6e62889c",
                                                "text": "Both ordines are related to an ordo in a pontifical in Reims, the Ordo of 1200 (Ordo XIX). The latter was to be consulted again and again, and its formulas were to have a marked effect upon the French ceremony; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d1f0dbf-13f5-4da0-bbec-af13d7edf919",
                                                "sense_id": "d0f66232-3031-3f62-bc49-c92a6e62889c",
                                                "text": "William Durandus, bishop of Mende in the south of France, compiled a pontifical in three books. William never intended his work to be a universal pontifical, but its clarity of arrangement and quality of substance, along with […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "118a8b55-8584-47d8-a8fc-e911f37f2488",
                        "source_entry_id": "de32cbc9-5740-3899-b31c-c379ba4e651c",
                        "source_sense_id": "1336e021-f421-3870-9642-cc17600db49f",
                        "target_lang_word": "pontifikál",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "19e8572d-9b22-4303-ab28-3fcc674729c7",
                        "source_entry_id": "de32cbc9-5740-3899-b31c-c379ba4e651c",
                        "source_sense_id": "1336e021-f421-3870-9642-cc17600db49f",
                        "target_lang_word": "pontifical",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pontifical",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dcf4cde6-086c-3db0-816c-631f1d72c74c",
                                        "entry_id": "5fe0956d-7a2a-38e1-ada3-1842289c7215",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui appartient à la dignité de pontife, d’évêque."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38516d76-814b-4f87-ae9f-1aa9b64acf92",
                                                "sense_id": "dcf4cde6-086c-3db0-816c-631f1d72c74c",
                                                "text": "En Occident, c’est simplement l’histoire d’un système social contrôlé et organisé de manière pontificale (c’est-à-dire épiscopale, puis papale), depuis que le clergé épiscopal est devenu le relais du pouvoir sénatorial."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "02b5a346-e1b5-394a-9ccc-4b64629b2799",
                                        "entry_id": "5fe0956d-7a2a-38e1-ada3-1842289c7215",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qualifie la dignité du souverain pontife, le pape."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66bb0c0d-7af6-46c2-a62b-2a52a6b3d3db",
                                                "sense_id": "02b5a346-e1b5-394a-9ccc-4b64629b2799",
                                                "text": "Faut-il rappeler, au surplus, que l'avant-dernier Pape, Pie IX, l'a caractérisée expressément comme un don gracieux de la puissance pontificale, comme une simple concession motivée par la dureté des temps ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7683853f-76d6-4326-8a6d-9a5090cf3dbe",
                                                "sense_id": "02b5a346-e1b5-394a-9ccc-4b64629b2799",
                                                "text": "Et quand une procession entre ou sort de la basilique St-Pierre, les cappa magna surmontés de mitres de leurs Eminentissimes Frivolités, les ceintures violettes, les bures noires, les bures brunes, les bures blanches qui défilent au pas d'une fanfare pontificale me semblent un remake de Fellini."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "pontifical",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b2b06524-23d9-342f-b257-b291a668d414",
                                        "entry_id": "923eeae1-39ec-313a-816b-ad4a4e78f71f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Livre qui contient les différentes prières et l’ordre des cérémonies que l’évêque doit accomplir particulièrement dans l’ordination, la confirmation, le sacre et les autres fonctions réservées aux évêques."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "237ab952-504e-4d8a-a7df-987661b819ea",
                                                "sense_id": "b2b06524-23d9-342f-b257-b291a668d414",
                                                "text": "Le pontifical romain. Cela est marqué dans le pontifical."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
